        skos:note        "A building of cultural significance  located at the Tampere central square. It was drawn by the architects Andersin, Jung, and Bomanson and it's construction was finished in 1899."@en , "Kulttuurihistoriallinen liiketalo Tampereen Keskustorilla. Talon suunnitteli arkkitehtitoimisto Andersin-Jung-Bomanson ja se valmistui 1899."@fi , "Kulturhistoriskt affärshus vid Centraltorget i Tammerfors. Huset ritades av arkitektbyrån Andersin-Jung-Bomanson och färdigställdes år 1899."@sv;
